            <ArticleTitle>A pillar[5]arene based gel from a low-molecular-weight gelator for sustained dye release in water.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>16802-16806</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1039/c7dt04001f</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A soft gel based on pillar[5]arene was successfully prepared using a carbazone reaction. Furthermore, dyes such as TPP or TPPE can be incorporated into this gel and were observed to be released in a sustained way in water due to solvent exchange.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
